    "Name": "MetalMax",
    "Details": "The MetalMax MX-2 mounts a spot welder in place of the left hand actuator alongside a rivet gun in the right arm with two tons of rivets. Fourteen tons of industrial armor and environmental sealing with four jump jets round out the design.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.76</color></b>",
